messages:
Lina R: Quick sync for NovaWave pilot — they require streaming with function/tool calls that produce strict JSON (schema-validated), EU data residency, and customer-managed keys. Commercial wants an anchor for 20 concurrent streams at ~3k tokens/request + burst to 40.

Omar T: I'll take the procurement/discount side. Do we have a one-pager example for a 1-month Dedicated pilot offer? Need something procurement-friendly.

Priya V: I can own the security questionnaire answers (KMS, data residency, audit artifacts). Can we confirm the exact wording for Dedicated vs Private deployment storage locations?

Devon (SE): On the SDK/integration front: we support streaming function_call deltas over websocket and gRPC. Default SDK waits for function_call.complete but you can enable incremental payloads with the request flag `partial_tool_payload=true`. Sample (Node):

Devon (SE): ```js
// minimal streaming sample (Node)
const ws = new WebSocket('wss://api.redwood.ai/v1/stream');
ws.on('open', () => {
  ws.send(JSON.stringify({
    type: 'start',
    model: 'redwood-stream-1',
    options: { partial_tool_payload: true, schema: 'urn:company:entity-v1' }
  }));
});
ws.on('message', raw => {
  const msg = JSON.parse(raw);
  // msg.type: 'delta' | 'function_call' | 'complete'
  // partial function args arrive as multiple deltas
  console.log(msg);
});
```

Devon (SE): Go snippet coming if you need it. Note: partial_tool_payload is opt-in and may increase CPU usage on client; first partials typically arrive within 40-180ms depending on model and seq length.

Priya V: Draft boilerplate for questionnaire: "For Dedicated and Private deployments, inference payloads and model artifacts are hosted in the customer's selected region/VPC. For Dedicated we can host in our EU region or deploy into a customer VPC for Private installs. We support customer-managed keys via major cloud KMS providers and on-prem HSMs. SOC2/ISO audit artifacts available under NDA; retention and telemetry controls are configurable." Will refine with infra.

Omar T: For price anchor: does streaming affect token billing? Also need a suggested Dedicated sizing for 20 steady streams @3k tokens each and a plan for bursts.

Devon (SE): Billing is token-based regardless of streaming. Dedicated helps reduce effective cost via batching and KV prefix caching. For a conservative pilot estimate: a medium model workload with 20 steady 3k-token streams (concurrent contexts) + headroom to 40 bursts -> start with 3 reserved GPU-equivalents and enable autoscale + a 1-2 GPU burst pool. This is a rough starting point — I recommend a 2-hour load test (20 x 3k steady + brief spike to 40) to validate.

Lina R: Action items: (1) Priya finalize security text and attach SOC2 link, (2) Devon post Node+Go snippets + perf note, (3) Omar draft 1-month pilot commercial anchor (include burst handling + cancellation terms), (4) Book 30-min kickoff Tue 10am CET.

Devon (SE): Will drop Go snippet and a tiny load-harness by EOD. I'll also open a runbook for the test. Suggest eng-ml run the quick load to confirm sizing.

InfraBot: Runbook created: runbook://novawave-poc-3170001234 (access: sales,se,security,infra).

Priya V: I'll ping infra for exact EU region placement options and confirm KMS providers supported.

Omar T: I'll draft the procurement-friendly anchor: suggest "30% credit on first month of Dedicated pilot, up to X GPU-hours included; overage billed at list with daily metering" — will confirm with Finance.

Devon (SE): Quick integration note: if NovaWave needs to act on partial args as they arrive (e.g., start a downstream API call before function_call.complete), enable partial_tool_payload and validate partials against your schema progressively. We also provide a small helper in the SDK to stream-validate incremental JSON fragments.

Lina R: Please add any blockers here. If infra needs a warm pool in EU, flag it so we can get lead time.

Priya V: I'll post the full questionnaire responses once infra confirms exact wording.

Omar T: Thanks team — I'll loop in AM and Finance and share draft anchor by EOD.

Devon (SE): ETA for snippets + harness: EOD today. If you want early access to the partial-mode helper, ping me and I'll provision a test token.

Lina R: Great work. I'll send the calendar invite and include this thread in the kickoff doc: https://short.link/novawave-kickoff :thumbsup:
